fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=551e0f7cc332842d45f5f337eb01bd7c 2x, https://si.imgix.net/070e4e0e/uploads/origins/c53547e9-70bb-46ea-af32-4dfb47c35aa5?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=efaa76062d6d9c4d8f130efa46d161bc 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello shimazaki sensei! I really like your artstyle and works!\nI am a overseas Vtuber and I would like to commission you for a work for my character!\nThe work will be used in Vtubing activities such as SNS posts and video thumbnails.\n\nThe character is an emotionally unstable fox devil! She is usually smug and being a mesugaki, but may also become yandere or kind under certain conditions. She also has a strong sense of possessiveness.\n\nThe posing and expression are up to you!\nIt would be appreciated if the character and the background can be separated in different layers!\n\nThank you very much in advance!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1JSaqmFF7YNKzAHCdomT43r555CINv54e?usp=drive_link", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@shimazaki1152/works/40", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/39fb1701/uploads/origins/1794888b-3261-4689-bfee-8a8804e2eb2f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1a30026979b27f6fbac1db85031b91dd", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/39fb1701/uploads/origins/1794888b-3261-4689-bfee-8a8804e2eb2f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1a30026979b27f6fbac1db85031b91dd, https://si.imgix.net/39fb1701/uploads/origins/1794888b-3261-4689-bfee-8a8804e2eb2f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1608a6372b941e9ffa73ba0ba563dc22 2x, https://si.imgix.net/39fb1701/uploads/origins/1794888b-3261-4689-bfee-8a8804e2eb2f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=18d0f45a50e2412b97107037acf95070 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "はじめまして、vtuberの砂糖うさぎと申します。\n新着